{
  "about": "States v1 could not open, added to v1's routes. Each `storage` is written to localStorage before the page loads and put back after it is measured; nothing reaches the database. db60-pre is the harness's book with no queries, so the pages scoped to the active book show their empty state, where they have one. The Dashboard's first visit (dashboard-fv) is already in v1's routes.",
